<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fisher's fundamental theorem of natural selection (partial-change form)" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The rate of increase in mean fitness of a population due to natural selection equals its additive genetic variance in fitness at that time." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/TestableHypothesis> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "\\Delta_{NS}\\bar{w} = V_A(w)/\\bar{w} (discrete generations); \\left.\\frac{d\\bar{m}}{dt}\\right|_{NS} = V_A(m) for Malthusian fitness m" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/context> "Assumptions: the 'partial change' holds average effects of alleles and the environment fixed (Price 1972, Ewens 1989); V_A is the additive genetic variance in fitness. Formal status: proved in this partial-change reading. Read as a claim about the total change in mean fitness it is false under dominance, epistasis, frequency dependence or a changing environment." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/proposedTest> "In a pedigreed wild population or an experimental-evolution line, estimate the additive genetic variance in relative fitness (animal model) and compare it with the observed per-generation response of breeding values for fitness, separating the selection term from environmental deterioration." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hypothesisType> "model-theorem" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Ronald A. Fisher (1930) The Genetical Theory of Natural Selection" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1469-1809.1972.tb00764.x> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/fisher-ftns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-5809(89)90028-2> .
}
